# final-run10: cold-start breaker profile
# Lesson from run 9: NEVER cap max-num-seqs (causes head-of-line blocking on long reasoning).
# Lesson from run 8: budget 2048 prevents prefill chunks from dragging decodes past 50 ms.
# Power: 350W gives full Tensor Core TFLOPS to keep prefill fast and TPOT < 45 ms.
# Backend: FlashInfer for fast paged attention decodes.
CMKL/MANGO1.5-Qwen3.5-9B-AWQ-W4A16-mtp
--host 0.0.0.0
--port 8000
--served-model-name mango1.5-awq-w4a16
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.92
--max-model-len 40960
--max-num-batched-tokens 2048
--attention-backend FLASHINFER
--enable-prefix-caching
--mamba-cache-mode align
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
--reasoning-parser qwen3
